  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a welcoming touch for any classroom, featuring a unique composition notebook style. Designed for both visual appeal and daily function, it serves as an inviting accent piece while helping to maintain cleanliness. Ideal for educators, this doormat combines a distinctive design with practical features for a high-traffic environment.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher’s name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Thoughtful gift for various occasions, including back-to-school.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable non-woven fabric top ensures comfort.</li>\n<li>Neoprene rubber backing provides non-slip functionality.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime to keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor classroom use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap; avoid bleaching; air dry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is perfect for classrooms, entryways, and even RVs, providing a personalized and functional accent. Its durable construction makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings, welcoming students and guests alike.</p>",
